# Model Routing

Use `docs/ai-context/MODEL_ROUTING.md` when recommending model families.

Do not recommend the current model by default. Recommend based on ambiguity, architecture impact, edit volume, exactness, UI/design judgment, security/data risk, and current-docs needs.

For high-risk work, consider a two-model workflow: frontier model for planning/review, implementation model for bounded edits.
